P("teen","A shortening of teenager or teenage, ultimately based on the final element of numerals thirteen through nineteen.",[C("teen.s1","age","The program is open to any teen between thirteen and nineteen.","這項計畫開放給十三至十九歲的青少年參加。","a teen aged + number","Noun: a person aged from thirteen to nineteen.","The person falls within the stated age range."),C("teen.s2","culture","The magazine covers teen music and fashion.","這本雜誌介紹青少年音樂與時尚。","teen + noun","Adjective: connected with people aged thirteen to nineteen.","Teen modifies music and identifies its connection with that age group.")],[M("The club welcomes teens, but excludes everyone between thirteen and nineteen.","The club welcomes teens, including people between thirteen and nineteen.","A teen is a person aged from thirteen to nineteen.","meaning")],[Q("teen.q1","teen.s1","meaning","Who is a teen?","A person aged from thirteen to nineteen.","A child aged exactly two.","A person who measures land for a living.","The noun refers to a person in the thirteen-to-nineteen age range."),Q("teen.q2","teen.s2","context","What does teen fiction usually mean?","Fiction connected with teenage readers or experiences.","A story sent by electrical telegraph.","A manual for measuring remote temperatures.","As an adjective, teen means connected with people of that age."),Q("teen.q3","teen.s1","distinction","Which person is a teen?","A fifteen-year-old student.","A ten-year-old student.","A twenty-two-year-old teacher.","Fifteen falls within the thirteen-to-nineteen range."),Q("teen.q4","teen.s2","word-choice","Choose the natural phrase.","teen audience","teen the audience yesterday","audience teened quickly","Teen can modify a noun to mean related to teenagers.")]);
